Pengyu Shi
  
# Bubble rising near wall
Interaction of a rising bubble with a vertical wall:
[bubble-wall.c](bubble-wall.c)

It was used for the numerical investigations reported in:

* P. Shi, J. Zhang and J. Magnaudet,  
  *Lateral migration and bouncing of a deformable bubble rising near a vertical wall. Part 1. Moderately inertial regimes*,  
  J. Fluid Mech. **998**, A8 (2024).

* P. Shi, J. Zhang and J. Magnaudet,  
  *Lateral migration and bouncing of a deformable bubble rising near a vertical wall. Part 2. Highly inertial regimes*,  
  J. Fluid Mech. **1013**, A19 (2025).


## Rise regimes of freely rising droplets

The following codes were used for the numerical simulations reported in:

P. Shi, D. Lucas, J. Zhang, É. Climent and D. Legendre,
[Rise regimes of freely rising droplets with a moderate viscosity ratio](https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.08575),
arXiv:2606.08575 (2026).

* [Axisymmetric simulation](rising_drop_axi.c)
* [Three-dimensional simulation](rising_drop_3d.c)
